and not too far from restaurants.

539
00:32:32.933 --> 00:32:35.933
Now, you run to handle user query.

540
00:32:40.100 --> 00:32:42.200
Here you can see that
the vector search operation

541
00:32:42.200 --> 00:32:45.900
